sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst as Analyst<br/>browser user
    participant React as React app<br/>shared filters · charts
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI<br/>/api/* endpoints
    participant Query as Query layer<br/>whitelist · lru_cache
    participant DuckDB as DuckDB<br/>hc.duckdb · read-only

    Analyst->>React: click bar "age 25-34"
    activate React
    Note over React: update shared filters (all pages)
    React->>FastAPI: GET /api/by/income_type<br/>?age_bucket=25-34
    activate FastAPI
    Note over FastAPI: check names against the whitelist<br/>unknown dimension or filter -> 400
    FastAPI->>Query: by_dimension(dim, filters)
    activate Query
    
    alt result already cached
        Note over Query: rows from memory · < 5 ms
    else first request for these filters
        Query->>DuckDB: SELECT ... GROUP BY 1
        activate DuckDB
        DuckDB-->>Query: rows · 50-200 ms
        deactivate DuckDB
        Note over Query: rows (cached for next time)
    end
    
    Query-->>FastAPI: 
    deactivate Query
    FastAPI-->>React: JSON · gzip
    deactivate FastAPI
    React-->>Analyst: charts, KPIs, tables re-render
    deactivate React
